ggml Metal: launch contiguous unary, row-broadcast binary and GLU ops with full threadgroups (up to 256
threads) instead of one thread per threadgroup / one threadgroup per GLU row. Cherry-picked from ggml-org/ggml
1329f7502b (llama.cpp #31075), the unary / binary / GLU part only (not the MXFP4 mat-vec change).

